        "title": "Gundai pui tingmik tang khang",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Gundai pui tingmik tang khang nathe,",
            "Chamloumei guang le kandih champan guai;",
            "Kauh thu rui khuangpui le nra rui,",
            "Ata kao e kanloumei pu rui.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Gundai pui tingmik khou,",
            "Kanlou khang chamdan na bammo;",
            "Kaguang bampang khou ding khang 2!-,",
            "Poubaumei tan hei tan dikho.",
            "",
            "2. Reinung Noah rui ringpui kan khou,",
            "Ningtou lana simei guai gan ngam mo;",
            "Man ngam puni aniu kandih hei ni,",
            "Gulou puni champan jat guai ta.",
            "",
            "3. Kachak namdai khou guangtang pukhou,",
            "Miram khou 2!- aniu nban thai ni;",
            "Lung rianramei le kapmei nai lak khe,",
            "Guloumei nahnun le ncham ni.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih khou gaimei ta ai ning the,",
            "Hei ramgai khou 2!- guangtang nipui nung;",
            "Guangdaimei guai le poubaumei daimei,",
            "Ringpui san thuan kho guang Khrista ta."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
